CodeSystem: DocumentTypeLocalCS
Id: document-type-local-cs
Title: "Local Document Types"
Description: "Detailed list of local document types (forms, cards, logs) used in Uzbekistan DHP."
* insert OriginalCodeSystemDraft(document-type-local-cs)

